            "sourceIndex": 2,
            "text": "Cut the zucchinis.",
            "mediaId": "wordpress-attachment:17918"
          },
          {
            "sourceIndex": 3,
            "text": "In a large pot, heat the olive oil, add onions and garlic. Cook until golden, while stirring constantly.",
            "mediaId": "wordpress-attachment:17916"
